---

<Layout
  title="Gandhi Jayanthi Celebration | Icon School of Excellence"
  description="Icon School of Excellence honors the legacy of Mahatma Gandhi on Gandhi Jayanthi with thoughtful activities and tributes in Bangalore."
  keywords="Gandhi Jayanthi Bangalore, school events, Mahatma Gandhi tributes, Icon School activities"
  robots="ndex, follow"
  canonical="https://iconschoolofexcellence.com/events/ganthi-jayanti"
>
  <EventsList
    event_title="Gandhi Jayanti"
    event_sub_title="Explore the latest photos from our Gandhi Jayanti celebration at ISOE"
    paragraph=` Gandhi Jayanti was celebrated with inspiring
                                speeches highlighting Mahatma Gandhi's
                                principles of non-violence and truth. Skits and
                                songs illustrated his teachings, while students
                                participated in a community service activity
                                (Swachh Bharat Abhiyan), embodying his spirit of
                                selflessness. The celebration deepened
                                appreciation for Gandhi's legacy and encouraged
                                everyone to embrace his ideals in daily life`
    images={images}
  />
</Layout>
